cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "RadarLab: An Open-Source FMCW MIMO Radar Simulator with a Browser Twin, Validated Against Detection and Estimation Theory"
abstract: >-
  Open-source FMCW TDM-MIMO radar simulation and processing framework with a
  NumPy reference implementation and an interactive TypeScript browser twin.
  Cross-language golden vectors check numerical equivalence for synthesis,
  MTI, FFT processing, CFAR, clustering and peak/angle estimation. The
  simulator is validated against independent closed-form detection and
  estimation theory, with implementation consistency checks reported
  separately.
authors:
